<title>UK: Phibro keep single Brent crude cargo - trade.</title>
<headline>Phibro keep single Brent crude cargo - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The only Brent cargo passing down the paper chains on Monday, a Shell U.K. equity cargo originally schedule to load May 14-16 but brought forward to May 13-15, was kept by U.S. trade house Phibro, traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
